  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* docs: improve README with \"go install\" command and prerequisites by @samuelroland in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/7\r\n* feat: remap section shortcuts for consistency by @mpospirit in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/14\r\n* chore: add repository tooling, CI gates and contributor docs by @ozemin in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/18\r\n* build(deps): bump the github-actions group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/19\r\n* fix: render chafa frames as PNG and gate --probe by version by @ozemin in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/17\r\n* fix: reject audio-only sources and carry fps as float64 by @ozemin in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/20\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @samuelroland made their first contribution in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/7\r\n* @mpospirit made their first contribution in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/14\r\n* @ozemin made their first contribution in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/18\r\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/pull/19\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ozemin/lazycut/compare/v0.3.9...v0.4.0",
